{"step_index":1357,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T17:23:14Z","content":"### Power Dialer HUD Ergonomic & Responsive Overhaul\n\n### Why the Overlap Was Happening\nPreviously, the HUD container did not use an outer scroll view and was using `flex: 1, justifyContent: 'flex-end'` for the disposition section. When an educator's card had handwritten questions, retirement checkboxes, and meeting availability, the content height expanded and pushed directly into the disposition controls.\n\n---\n\n### 📱 What Has Been Redesigned ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\n\n1. **Responsive Viewport:**\n   - Wrapped the entire cockpit in a smooth, responsive `<ScrollView>` with structured padding.\n   - Eliminates layout collision or overlapping across all mobile screen sizes, tablets, and orientations (portrait & landscape).\n\n2. **Clean Visual Hierarchy:**\n   - **Educator Intel Card**: Compact header with avatar, name, phone, school, classroom/room number, planning period badge, and FRS service years.\n   - **Report Card Needs & Handwritten Questions**: Rendered as organized tags and high-contrast callout boxes with clear padding.\n   - **High-Contrast Dial Button**: Prominent `Dial (386) 555-1234` action button placed cleanly inside the card above the disposition dock.\n\n3. **Unified 1-Tap Disposition Dock:**\n   - **Hero Full-Width Action**: **`🎯 APPOINTMENT SET`** banner styled in Heavenly Gold & Sacred Green with clear subtext (*\"Book classroom sit-down & record details\"*).\n   - **2x2 Quick Grid**:\n     - `💬 Spoke` (Connected)\n     - `📞 No Answer` (Advance & SMS)\n     - `✉️ AI SMS` (Personalized copy)\n     - `📅 Callback` (Set reminder)\n   - **Secondary Actions**: `🚫 Block / DNC` and `⏩ Skip Educator` cleanly separated at the bottom.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment Live\nThe responsive layout is live and ready to test on your phone:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
